 "remarks": "Welcome home to Mallards's Landing Condominium, a beautifully updated, light filled apartment. It offers a one-level living space located on the second floor of the building, with 2 bedrooms, and 2 baths.  The open layout concept with gleaming hardwood floors, renovated kitchen, stainless steel appliances, creates an inviting space for everyday stylish living, and entertainment. The spacious primary suite, features abundant closet space with a private bath. The second bedroom offers flexibility for guests, or an at home office. Brand new sliding doors are featured adjacent to the balcony area. Brand new windows were recently installed. Enjoy the convenience of a laundry area inside the unit, two assigned parking spaces, a separate private unit for storage, storage room for bikes, and a private community pool. Relax on your private balcony, and enjoy the peace of mind that comes with a community that has undergone extensive improvements. Capital projects include new siding, roofs, energy efficient windows, energy efficient sliding doors, deck areas. The renovations have tremendously enhanced both the beauty, and the long term value of the property. A monthly special assessment of $395 is expected to be completed by December 2026, or January 2027. Due to the final phase of construction, it is a cash, or non-warrantable financing only. The apartment units are conveniently located near the train station, and the I-95 expressway.",
